      "hz_4_evidence": "/mnt/work/runs/scaling-441d-seed11/20261027T191119.061322Z_2303ea6816b5/budget.json (usable_samples=3521680, point scaling-1.32 steps=145269) and exposure.json (coverage=1.0, effective_epochs=2.639994548056609, per_day 441 days 2022-01-04..2023-10-31)",
      "rankhinge_cause": "modified_tlob/adapter.py truncates every timestamp group to a multiple of batch_size, so a fixed 21,904 of the 3,521,680 rows (0.622%) are never fed at any budget; the R1 coverage ceiling is 3499776/3521680 = 0.993784 and no budget raises it",
