      "note_on_plan_estimate": "the parent rung plan carries usable_samples_estimate=3522173 with steps_expected {1.32: 145290, 2.64: 290579}; that is a static estimate 493 rows above the measured pool and the driver never uses it, so no 21-step discrepancy can reach a run",
      "comparability_basis": "the arms are compared on effective epochs (1.32) over the same ten windows; the exact step count is whatever each machine measures"
